# Throwaway probe scripts.
#
# Investigation in this repo leans on short-lived scripts for poking at the Pega
# export and Dataverse metadata. They are named with a leading underscore by
# convention so a `git add -A` cannot sweep them into a commit - which is
# exactly how `_t.py` once ended up tracked.
_*.py
_*.mjs
_*.js
_*.ps1

# Scratch output from those probes.
_slides/
_v/
_x/
_y/
_z/
_n/
